{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-club-drive","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"club-drive-at-dubai-hills-estate","about":"An elite new luxury development, Club Drive in Dubai Hills Estate is a welcome addition to one of Dubai's most well-known and adored master communities. Designed by Emaar Properties, the apartments at Club Drive are in a prime location, with 75% of units offering breathtaking views of the nearby Golf Course.The apartments at Club Drive, which are spread over two buildings, are all exceptionally designed. They range in size from 1 to 3 bedrooms. These residences are examples of cutting-edge architecture that fit well in with Dubai Hills Estate's luxurious vibe.Each apartment at Club Drive, like other Emaar apartments, has been carefully designed to provide the maximum amount of space and comfort for its occupants. Club Drive in Dubai Hills Estate provides its residents with more than just high-quality residences; it also provides them with a wide range of facilities. The centrally located Central Park and Dubai Hills Mall, both of which are conveniently close to the property, are examples of the careful planning that went into its site.","price":1500000,"title":"Club Drive","bitrix":{"id":270,"pf_id":"are.2.13226","source":null,"project_id":"Club Drive","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Club Drive","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai Hills Estate"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/clubdrive_feature_7701c07558.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/clubdrive_feature_7701c07558.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.106438,"lng":55.2471005},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/clubdrive_1_df4b19dae2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/clubdrive_1_df4b19d